{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27796","headline":"和项斯游头陀寺上方 · 欧阳衮","name":"和项斯游头陀寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步入桃源里，晴花更满枝。\n峰回山意旷，林杳竹光迟。\n远寺寻龙藏，名香发雁池。\n间能将远语，况及上阳时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}